<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans - Jan 1 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans - Jan 1 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED JANUARY 1</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............787,000 down...1,100</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......705,700 down.....200</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......518,000 up.....3,600</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....778,162 down...4,036</p>
<p> Financial companies.......603,632 up.....1,668</p>
<p> New York business loans....43,553 down.....177</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......43,316 down.....176</p>
</text>
